6. What is Stream API?

Input:

["John","Mike","Tom"]

Code:

List<String> names =
Arrays.asList("John","Mike","Tom");

names.stream()
     .filter(n -> n.startsWith("J"))
     .forEach(System.out::println);

Output:

John

Explanation:
Stream API processes collections in a functional and declarative style.

