17. What are Default Methods?

Input:

Car Object

Code:

interface Vehicle {

    default void start() {
        System.out.println("Starting");
    }
}

class Car implements Vehicle {
}

new Car().start();

Output:

Starting

Explanation:
Default methods allow implementation inside interfaces.

