=========================================================
JAVA 8 ONE-LINE MEMORY TRICKS
=========================================================

Lambda            → Anonymous Function
FunctionalInterface → One Abstract Method
Predicate         → Input → Boolean
Function          → Input → Output
Consumer          → Input Only
Supplier          → Output Only
Stream API        → Functional Collection Processing
filter()          → Select Data
map()             → Transform Data
flatMap()         → Flatten Collections
reduce()          → Aggregate Data
collect()         → Convert Data
Method Reference  → Class::Method
Optional          → Null Safety
Default Method    → Interface Implementation
Static Method     → Utility Method
LocalDate         → New Date API
Parallel Stream   → Multi-Core Processing
findFirst()       → First Element
findAny()         → Any Matching Element
